# Never uploaded by `vercel deploy`.
# Licensed fonts: the licences forbid redistribution (docs/adr/0002); the live site uses local() copies
# installed on the viewer's machine, else free fallbacks. Departure Mono (SIL OFL) is uploaded.
public/fonts/*
!public/fonts/DepartureMono-*
# Local secrets: Vercel has its own copies in project settings.
.env*
# Build output and dependencies: Vercel installs and builds itself.
.next/
node_modules/
